<Defs> 
 <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>Orichalcum</defName>
    <label>orichalcum</label>
    <description>Advanced and very recently developed alloy used in Lahlit manufacturing. Born in the fires of Lahlisek's blackest forge-pits, orichalcum is the only metallic substance in the galaxy that can boast to be sharper than plasteel.
	But alas, in classic Consortium fashion, its strengths come with an equal number of defects-orichalcum bends and snaps rather easily. Even gold has more resilience to impacts. 
	
	Although, this is slightly offset by the fact that orichalcum seamlessly conducts and even amplifies molecular disruption energies. Slightly.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Resource/Orichalcum</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <soundInteract>Metal_Drop</soundInteract>
    <soundDrop>Metal_Drop</soundDrop>
    <useHitPoints>false</useHitPoints>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>12</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.25</Mass>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Sharp>0.7</StuffPower_Armor_Sharp>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Blunt>0.3</StuffPower_Armor_Blunt>
      <StuffPower_Armor_Heat>0.9</StuffPower_Armor_Heat>
      <StuffPower_Insulation_Cold>3</StuffPower_Insulation_Cold>
      <StuffPower_Insulation_Heat>6</StuffPower_Insulation_Heat>
      <SharpDamageMultiplier>1.5</SharpDamageMultiplier>
      <BluntDamageMultiplier>0.7</BluntDamageMultiplier>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ResourcesRaw</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <burnableByRecipe>false</burnableByRecipe>
    <smeltable>true</smeltable>
    <stuffProps>
      <categories>
        <li>Metallic</li>
      </categories>
      <appearance>Metal</appearance>
      <constructEffect>ConstructMetal</constructEffect>
      <isAirtight>true</isAirtight>
      <color>(28,40,25)</color>
      <soundImpactBullet>BulletImpact_Metal</soundImpactBullet>
      <soundMeleeHitSharp>MeleeHit_Metal_Sharp</soundMeleeHitSharp>
      <soundMeleeHitBlunt>MeleeHit_Metal_Blunt</soundMeleeHitBlunt>
      <soundImpactMelee>Pawn_Melee_Punch_HitBuilding_Metal</soundImpactMelee>
      <statFactors>
        <MaxHitPoints>2.8</MaxHitPoints>
        <Beauty>1</Beauty>
        <Flammability>0</Flammability>
        <MeleeWeapon_CooldownMultiplier>0.6</MeleeWeapon_CooldownMultiplier>
      </statFactors>
    </stuffProps>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Medium</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <allowedArchonexusCount>80</allowedArchonexusCount>
  </ThingDef>
  
